A strong reference implementation for understanding how major Stellar DeFi protocols fit together in one product.

Useful for:
- seeing how protocol composition works
- understanding API shapes and response formats
- working with lending, swaps, and price feeds
- understanding portfolio-style UI patterns

| Protocol | What it demonstrates |
